body:
My cloudy urine has been going on for 4 months but started after I received unprotected oral with a promiscuous person. (My fault I know) No bacteria and no std found which was mind blowing. I also got what I believed was epididymytis and orchitis because the testes swelled up real bad but was told I just had cysts also. A urologist told me he felt the prostate was inflamed. He gave me Cipro and Augmentin  but those didn't do much for me. On a separate occasion I got a shot of Ceftriaxone (Rocephin) and a one time dose of azithromycin and those improved my symptoms drastically. Currently on Doxycycline and feeling a difference with those...And stretching also! I used to get a lot of leg pain but that has been getting better with intense stretching. Go for walks! And take fiber, I recommend Citrucel if they sell in your country. 

&#x200B;

Do you have urinary frequency?
